{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24251","headline":"荅皇甫十郎中秋深酒熟见忆 · 白居易","name":"荅皇甫十郎中秋深酒熟见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟景冷苍茫，秋深夜夜霜。\n爲思池上酌，先觉瓮头香。\n未暇倾巾漉，还应染指尝。\n醍醐慙气味，琥珀让晶光。\n若许陪歌席，须容散道场。\n月终斋戒毕，犹及菊花黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}